---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Francois Gerber - About">
  <PageHeader title="Who Am I?" />

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I build systems that turn the open web into data a business can act on. Most recently that
    means an LLM-powered crawling platform inside Palantir Foundry: identifying, extracting and
    paginating across thousands of company websites a day, feeding marketplaces data used across
    Ringier's businesses.
    <br /><br />
    Before that I built and ran the crawling and processing platform at Ringier South Africa —
    user-configurable pipelines that scrape, process and distribute market intelligence in near
    real time, in C#, Python, Vue and React on AWS.
    <br /><br />
    I started out in industrial software: a refinery modernisation that replaced a dozen
    standalone tools with one platform wired to scales, label printers and PLCs, and a safety and
    operational-intelligence suite deployed to twelve mining sites that won the 2018 Health and
    Safety Software Award.
    <br /><br />
    I am a full-stack developer by training (.NET, SQL, TypeScript) who now spends most of the day
    in data: pipelines, extraction quality, and the unglamorous work of making a crawl dependable
    at scale.
    <br /><br />
    Currently Senior .NET Full Stack Developer at Ringier South Africa, based in Flic en Flac,
    Mauritius. The <a href="/projects">projects page</a> is the short version of all of this.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Details</div>
  </div>

